description=Auto-starts the global DTS:X audio processor (JAMU RootlessAudioProcessorService) on every boot. Reboot-persistent, no app interaction needed. Pairs with the DTS 开启器 (me.timschneeberger.rootlessjamesdsp) app which must stay installed.
